WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.929
Meaning changes with clear pronunciation and appropriate voice pitch in statements

00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:05.789
and questions.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:12.092
Which action improves reading fluency? Answer: Read familiar passages aloud with

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:12.590
expression.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.930
Read the same sentence as a question and as a statement, then compare the tone.

00:00:18.783 --> 00:00:21.749
Discuss why: Practice supports pace and expression.
